<title>BRAZIL: Telebras Feb net 506 mln reais - report.</title>
<headline>Telebras Feb net 506 mln reais - report.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's telecommunication giant Telebras posted a February net profit of 506 million reais, up from 279 million reais in January, Invest News reported.</p>
<p>The financial news agency said Telebras released the results in a statement to Brazilian stock exchanges.</p>
<p>((-- John Miller, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 248-5414))</p>
